<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33977" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμβᾰτ-ήριος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for
			marching</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. παιάν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Lyc.</u>
					22
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				14.630f
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κινήσεις ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Phillis
				3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ</span>. (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλος</span>), τό,
				<i>marching tune</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.20.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Polyaen.
				1.10
			</span></i>; of the anapaests of Tyrtaeus, <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				2.59
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ</span>. (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερά</span>), τά, <i>offerings
				made on embarking, before weighing anchor</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. θύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					5.43
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾄδειν καὶ σπένδειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					5.15
				</span></i>
			: also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. θυσία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.16
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
